{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/pulls/2086","id":4891655287,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSaSRXM8AAAABI5C8dw","html_url":"https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/pull/2086","diff_url":"https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/pull/2086.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/pull/2086.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/issues/2086","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/pulls/2086/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/pulls/2086/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/issues/2086/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/statuses/2ee8eabb7dbe2c4cd87f1cdc54b4cd4410584555","number":2086,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"perf(graph): reuse cached parameter annotation values","user":{"login":"jonathanong","id":643505,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzUwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/643505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong","html_url":"https://github.com/jonathanong","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanong/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Caches prepared parameter annotations in the existing request-scoped parameter cache, so repeated reads compute each annotation once per cache key and generation. Evaluation temporaries now drop before annotation construction; the same lease, dependency tracking, and value semantics remain intact.\n\nThe previous source failed the frozen cold RSS gate despite repeated-read CPU wins. That complete adverse result remains below. This revision stays DRAFT pending its exact-head CI and a separately reviewed performance comparison; no memory or speed claim follows from the lifetime change alone.\n\n## Related issues\n\n- Closes #2076.\n\n## Validation\n\n- 677 focused graph/typed-rule tests pass, including full-value old/new lifetime oracles, generation, catalog and cycle guards. Parameter coverage is 100%; provenance exceeds 99% for lines and regions.\n- Default Clippy and all normal publication hooks pass.\n- Fresh release CLI/addon: eight native API tests, a full 15,424-byte prepared report, and eight CLI raw outputs match retained baseline bytes. Actual producer is `099` plus the sealed five-path overlay; published `2ee8` preserves all 2,751 actual default compile inputs after merging current main `e0b38220`.\n- Exact-head Test CI [38959592766](https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/actions/runs/38959592766) and revised-source performance gates are pending.\n\nWorkspace setup: Dedicated PR worktree with an ordinary current-main merge; authentic release artifacts retain their original producer labels.\nAgent: Codex (GPT-6), session nm2076-parameter-annotation-cache\nDevice: jong@jong-z890-eagle-wifi7-plus\nWorktree: no-mistakes-2076-publish\n\n<details>\n<summary>Shepherd Journal</summary>\n\n- Published draft at `0076d3d7068ca2bc51d6957e25ee3c288a2e3415` with all normal hooks passing, including all-target/all-feature Clippy. The saved regression records 24 annotation evaluations before caching and 1 afterward; 672 focused graph/typed-rule tests pass, with 100% parameter-path coverage and >99% provenance coverage. Six compiled CJS/ESM/prepared API tests passed on the retained historical release candidate `5235102fb` / baseline source `4aea22103`. Main `5decc19aa` is integrated with all 18 feature files byte-identical, but its full native validation, exact-head CI/global98 coverage, and matched cold/consuming/non-consuming CPU/wall/RSS gates remain pending. The obsolete owned baseline build was cancelled after main changed; no timing samples or performance PASS exist. Keep DRAFT; do not start readiness/merge iteration before the remaining gates are genuinely satisfied.\n- Published head 0076d3d7068ca2bc51d6957e25ee3c288a2e3415 passed Test CI 38936559882 and all four Codecov contexts. Independent raw TOTAL readback: 98.4958% regions, 99.3870% functions, 99.3535% lines, with all configured 98% floors unchanged. This validates the published main5de integration, not the prospective c896 integration. Current native/performance gates remain pending and this PR remains draft. Evidence: /tmp/nm2076-ci-after-prospective-start/actual-exact-head-global98-review.json.\n- 2026-10-16: Isolated x86 run https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/actions/runs/38952882472 completed the unchanged 256-row ABBA/BAAB protocol, fresh full-output/native controls, and current-head CI checks. Independent numerical reproduction matched all 24 metrics. Frozen acceptance FAIL: cold-timings peak RSS +0.6398% (95% bootstrap interval +0.1387% to +1.2418%; 19,247.75 to 19,371 KiB; both orders positive). Scale CPU fell 26.4153% and scale-timings CPU fell 24.4863%, but these wins do not override the memory gate. PR remains draft. Preserve this complete adverse result; investigate allocation/lifetime and image-layout causes before any source revision or separately reviewed diagnostic experiment. Actual source producers remain c896 baseline and the recorded 0076/d410 candidate tree, with verified e0/099 production carry. Earlier run 38950862496 failed draft-asset transport before controls/samples and is retained separately.\n- 2026-10-16: Published `2ee8eabb7dbe2c4cd87f1cdc54b4cd4410584555`, integrating current main `e0b38220` and retiring evaluator temporaries before annotation construction while the same cache lease remains held. Saved object/indexed-cold oracles preserve full values, one annotation per generation, and cycle/catalog guards; 677 focused tests pass. Parameter coverage is 100% line/function/region; provenance is 99.16%/100%/99.36%. Default Clippy initially exposed an unchanged feature-only test import; the matching import cfg fixes that compiler regression without suppression, and the same command then passes. Fresh authentic release CLI/addon and matching core/dependencies passed eight real native tests, full 15,424-byte prepared-report equality, and eight full CLI outputs versus retained baseline bytes. These artifacts were built from `099` plus the sealed five-path overlay; all 2,751 actual default source inputs match published `2ee8`, with main carry limited to tests/docs/CI. All normal commit/push hooks pass. Exact-head Test CI 38959592766 is registered; its final gates and this revised source’s separately reviewed performance experiment remain pending. The prior 099 isolated RSS FAIL above is immutable and is not replaced by these functional results. Keep DRAFT; no readiness/merge loop.\n</details>","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-16T17:01:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T20:12:43Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7a88bd87074b146da1f254b94e799ba19990efc1","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jonathanong:fix/2076-parameter-annotation-cache","ref":"fix/2076-parameter-annotation-cache","repo":{"id":1235521884,"node_id":"R_kgDOSaSRXA","name":"no-mistakes","full_name":"jonathanong/no-mistakes","owner":{"login":"jonathanong","id":643505,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzUwNQ==","avatar_url":"https